{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set of outfits and items themed after Japan\u2019s traditional Children\u2019s Day celebration. Available in shops at Yano Market and Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes new dessert recipes using matcha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orient Mail, Orient Mail: Elnea, Orient Mail: Red Crane, Indigo Ramie Jinbei, Black Ramie Jinbei</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbDyes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abyssal Green Hair Dye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbJapanese Sweets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Wiala\u2019s Tavern and Warm 'n' Toasty Grill in Yano Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wa Bamboo Leaf Rice Cake, Wa Oak Leaf Rice Cake</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbMatcha</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two new dessert recipes using matcha will also be added to your kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328650?t=1744333166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.s